# Action classes for park CCTV footage - a STARTING POINT, edit freely.
# Rules: ids are 1..N with no gaps; names have no spaces (they become CVAT attribute names);
# keep the two-space indentation (the upstream reader is line-based).
# After changing this file also update configs/ava_to_park.yaml and re-run tools/build_annotations.py.
